        <config key="annotation_0">
            <entry key="text" type="xstring" value="select appropriate data and LIMMA test settings%%00010%%00010A) direct usage of MaxLFQ or further normalized MaxLFQ data%%00010- most of the time the MaxLFQ data can be used directly%%00010- sometimes, based on the normalization test QC figures you may notice reduction of the variability by further MaxLFQ data normalization (e.g., using loessF) and this is the situation where you may want to apply and test the alternative branch using normalized MaxLFQ data%%00010%%00010B) LIMMA test without or with block design usage %%00010- mainly based on the experimental design and or quality control figures (Normalization test metanode)"/>
